             every other card hangs at 20% of it, so showing it used to move the
             whole block — and the block moved while the outgoing ending line was
             still fading, which re-laid that line out mid-dissolve. That is one
             of R2f's two text flickers (see showCard in walk.ts). A lockup with
             its own place on the stage cannot move anything else on the way in.

