            <p class="signoff-mark">Time Series of India</p>
            <span class="signoff-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="signoff-line">wishes you a happy Independence Day</p>
            <!-- The picture the two buttons under it are about.
                 `data-src` rather than `src`, and it is the one deferral on this
                 page: card.png is the full 1080x1350 share asset (about a
                 megabyte), it lives at the dead centre of the stage from first
